### 3.4  Community & Multi‑Exchange Wrappers
* **[cryptoexchange](https://rubydoc.info/gems/cryptoexchange/0.27.0)** – Ruby gem that normalises REST/WebSocket APIs for 100+ exchanges, including YoBit, Crex24, Bithumb, Upbit, etc.
* **[crypto‑exchange‑mcp](https://www.npmjs.com/package/crypto-exchange-mcp)** – Node.js MCP service that provides offline documentation for Binance, OKX, Bybit, Bitget, Gate.io, etc.
* **[ccxt](https://github.com/ccxt/ccxt)** – Unified JavaScript / Python / PHP library for 200+ exchanges; ideal for building a custom “allPairs” aggregator.
